# Cloud Build context upload filter (used by `gcloud builds submit`). If ABSENT, gcloud falls back to
# .gitignore, which excludes apps/run-task/vendor (gitignored) and would ship a no-SDK run-task image.
# So this file exists precisely to KEEP the vendored SDK + all package sources in the upload while
# dropping installed deps / build outputs (the Dockerfiles reinstall + rebuild from the lockfile).
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.agents
agent-scratch
**/*.log
# Keep: apps/run-task/vendor (the Agent SDK the run-task image COPYs explicitly).
